# 14 Sep 2026 — WKBD_repo/ is now road-tested (path-portability fixed, Ch2+Ch3 both
# mirrored, appendix tables included) and un-ignored so it can actually go public.
# Two subfolders stay excluded even so:
#   - codex_replication/ is a separate, NOT builder-managed third-party AI-audit sandbox
#     (its own ERRORS_FOR_CLAUDE_CODE.md notes are internal, not replication content)
#   - manuscript/ holds the actual Chapter Two book text — publishing manuscript prose
#     needs its own explicit go-ahead, not a side effect of the code/data/appendix mirror
#     going live; not confirmed this session (today's scope discussion was about Chapter
#     Three's code/data/appendix, not Chapter Two's manuscript text).
WKBD_repo/codex_replication/
WKBD_repo/manuscript/

# ⚠ Found while un-ignoring WKBD_repo/ above: the older root-level "figures/" and "tables/"
# rules further up this file (no leading "/", so gitignore treats them as unanchored and they
# ALSO match WKBD_repo/figures/ and WKBD_repo/tables/, not just the top-level working-tree
# folders they were written for) were silently blocking every figure and appendix table in the
# mirror even after WKBD_repo/ itself was un-ignored. Never surfaced before because WKBD_repo/
# was fully blanket-ignored anyway. Explicit re-un-ignore needed here.
!WKBD_repo/figures/
!WKBD_repo/tables/

